  - id: the_marriage_covenant
    displayName: The Marriage Covenant
    flavorText: Rebukes the men of Judah for dealing treacherously against 'the wife
      of thy youth' through divorce and intermarriage with worshippers of a foreign
      god, declaring that the LORD hateth putting away.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Rebukes the men of Judah for dealing treacherously -- both by marrying
      women devoted to a foreign god and by divorcing the wives of their youth --
      grounding the charge in a shared covenant and stating that the LORD hateth
      putting away.
    deliveredByManagerId: malachi
    managerId: treachery_against_wives
