  - id: the_refiners_fire
    displayName: The Refiner's Fire
    flavorText: Announces that the LORD will suddenly send 'the messenger of the
      covenant' to His temple, whose purifying work is likened to a refiner's fire
      and fullers' soap purging the sons of Levi.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Answers the people's weary complaint 'Where is the God of judgment?'
      with the announcement that the LORD will send a messenger to prepare the way,
      followed by the sudden coming of the messenger of the covenant to His temple,
      whose purifying work purges the sons of Levi.
    deliveredByManagerId: malachi
