  - id: the_storehouse
    displayName: The Storehouse
    flavorText: Charges Israel with robbing God through withheld tithes and offerings,
      then challenges them to bring the whole tithe into the storehouse and prove
      the LORD's promised blessing.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Charges Israel with robbing God through withheld tithes and offerings,
      and issues a direct challenge to bring the whole tithe into the storehouse
      and test whether the LORD will not open the windows of heaven in blessing.
    deliveredByManagerId: malachi
