  - id: the_book_of_remembrance
    displayName: The Book of Remembrance
    flavorText: Records that those who feared the LORD spoke often one to another,
      and a book of remembrance was written before Him, promising a coming day that
      shall burn as an oven for the proud and wicked.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Addresses the complaint that serving God seems futile while the wicked
      prosper, answered by a book of remembrance written before the LORD for those
      who feared Him, and the promise of a coming day that shall burn as an oven
      consuming the wicked while the Sun of righteousness arises with healing for
      those who fear His name.
    deliveredByManagerId: malachi
    managerId: book_of_remembrance_day_of_the_lord
